  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">223209_FY24_WFP_Kenya_Kakuma GFD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective through the General Food Distribution is to facilitate acceptable food consumption for the refugees.
 
 Specific objectives are to;
 
 
 
 - Plan and execute efficient and effective food distribution systems to ensure refugees have access to in-kind food assistance as per the approved food basket.
 
 - Secure WFP properties at the FDP and ensure prepositioned food is guarded in the food distribution points within the camp.
 
 - Accurately account for WFP food assistance resources distributed through the partner.
 
 - Comply with reporting requirements, timelines and content in formats shared by WFP.
 
 - Ensure robust beneficiary complaints and feedback response systems.
 
 - Convene Food Advisory Committee meetings once a month, ensure food basket information is shared with refugee leadership and obtain feedback for action by stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
